[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華、二次審査も通ってたぞ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001030010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "やった、思った通り！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "007",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/700700103/7007001030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお。また自信があったんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001030020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そりゃあもちろん",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700103/7007001030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001030030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "だってプロデューサーが頑張ってくれたこと知ってるし？\r\n三峰は大丈夫だって思ってたよー",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700103/7007001030030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001030040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ありがとね、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700103/7007001030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、どういたしまして",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも結華は、もっと自分のことを認めてやった方がいいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "二次審査を通過できたのは、\r\n俺がどうこうってことじゃなくて、結華の実力なんだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001030050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサーは優しいなぁ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700103/7007001030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001030060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰も、自分は何もしてないって思ってるわけじゃないよ？\r\nでも、ひとりじゃ無理だったと思うんだよね",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700103/7007001030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001030070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "特にほら！　プロデューサーが懐を痛めて\r\n食べさせてくれたあのケーキ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700103/7007001030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001030080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あれが決め手だったんじゃないかと三峰は思うんだけど～",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700103/7007001030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それなら買った甲斐もあったってもんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001030090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "だからね？　三峰からもプロデューサーに、\r\nなにかお礼ができればと思ったり",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700103/7007001030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、大丈夫だぞ。そんな気を遣わなくて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001030100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ちょ、違うでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700103/7007001030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001030110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そこはさ、「じゃあ結華の『W.I.N.G.』優勝を！」って\r\n言うところじゃない？",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700103/7007001030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ悪い、\r\nそれはもうもらえるものと思ってたから別枠かと思って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001030120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あーららぁ、すごい信頼……\r\nそこまで褒められたら、まだ頑張るしかないね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700103/7007001030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 7007001030130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "よーし、三次審査もこの調子で行ってみよう！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700700103/7007001030130"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]